# Changing only J.java makes dep pass Java sources alone to scalac. U changes too, so use
# recompiles against dep's early output. When Scala 3 skips dependencyPhaseCompleted, which it
# can under load, the early jar must not lose J.tasty.

> use/compile

$ copy-file changes/J.java dep/J.java
$ copy-file changes/U.scala use/U.scala
> use/compile
